# Everything in this repo is deployed to Linux — Ansible playbooks and Jinja2
# templates, systemd units, shell scripts, Kubernetes manifests, Python. LF is
# correct unconditionally, so normalise on commit and check out LF on every
# platform regardless of the cloner's core.autocrlf.
#
# Why this is here: cloning on Windows with Git's default core.autocrlf=true
# rewrote all ~280 files to CRLF in the working tree on 2026-07-27. That is not
# cosmetic — scripts/verify-lab.py became `#!/usr/bin/env python3\r`, which
# Linux rejects with "bad interpreter", and CRLF would have leaked into
# rendered systemd units from the .j2 templates.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.wav binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.zip binary
